// Accept twin of reject/E-KIND-KEYWORD-SHAPE/bare-parameterized-ward.ron:
// the SAME keyword used through its macro invocation — `Ward` is declared
// `CountedCost` (the cost + the optional ward-{X} `where_x` definition,
// [CR#702.21a,702.21b]) and the invocation carries the typed cost arg, so
// the shape check resolves.
Normal(
  name: "Accept Invoked Ward",
  types: [Creature],
  abilities: [
    Keyword(Ward(cost: [Mana([Generic(2)])])),
  ],
  power: 1,
  toughness: 1,
)
